Clicking the roulette is just cosmetic.  First iteration there were people who showed screenshots of it landing on something and getting something else.

&amp;#x200B;

As you can imagine, if the gamecrashed while roulette spun what would happen?  It has to give you a result even if you never clicked it.  So it's just cosmetic and your value is already computed once you pull up the roulette screen.

